---
/**
 * 32 · Outward Breath
 *
 * Two open side arcs move away from a calm centre, turning concentric expansion into visible outward motion.
 *
 * One ring is broken symmetrically at both top and bottom, leaving paired side arcs. The field is 66.7% of the painted area, leaving
 * the rings subordinate to the face rather than turning the mark into a bevel.
 *
 * The face uses the measured sm/gap2 geometry:
 * field y5-20,
 * 4px air above and 4px below.
 */
